<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.1800 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.1800 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.1800 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 75.3800 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Mar 13		  Mar 12</p>
<p> High			     75.1200		 75.3800</p>
<p> Low				75.4001		 75.5500</p>
<p> Open			     75.4001		 75.4701</p>
<p> Close			    75.1800		 75.3800</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		 11.005		   4.260</p>
<p> YENGE PER MARK		 Mar 13		  Mar 12</p>
<p> High			     45.0800		 44.2800</p>
